      "description": "批量写入多个文件\n\n一次性写入多个文件，提高效率。\n\nArgs:\n    files: 文件列表，格式：[{\"path\": \"...\", \"content\": \"...\"}, ...]\n\nReturns:\n    批量操作结果\n\nExample:\n    files = [\n        {\"path\": \"topic_brief.json\", \"content\": \"{...}\"},\n        {\"path\": \"characters/role1.json\", \"content\": \"{...}\"}\n    ]",
      "input_schema": {
